  "timeframe": "2026-11-09T21:00:00Z/2026-11-23T21:00:00Z (use daily period, Sum statistic)",
  "criteria": "For each model with any cache activity: total cache read tokens, cache write tokens, uncached input tokens, cache hit ratio = read/(read+write+uncached input), daily trend (improving/degrading, notable days). Also list models with Invocations/InputTokenCount but ZERO cache read/write (caching not in use) with their input token volume. Estimate cost impact using current Bedrock on-demand pricing for the relevant models if you can verify it (cache reads typically ~10% of input price, cache writes ~125% for Anthropic models; verify with verify_aws_claim or docs) and report net savings vs no-caching, plus whether cache writes are being wasted (write high, read low). If the metrics don't exist, say so, and note if model invocation logging/other sources would be needed. Return a concise summary with a table of numbers, and state clearly any assumptions."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Analyze Bedrock prompt cache metrics in us-east-1 over 14 days"}], "created_at": null}

